{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up from a nightmare. You can't count how many times you've had a nightmare this month. But this time, after waking up, you find some strange phenomena in your house. You want to go out to see, but the door is locked...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/39c18655a986beddb63b5a10d01ce302.poster.avif?t=1750206690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/39c18655a986beddb63b5a10d01ce302.webm?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/39c18655a986beddb63b5a10d01ce302.mp4?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game, you play as an ordinary man living in an apartment and trying his best to escape this nightmare. The main focus of the game is puzzle exploration, followed by some parkour and platforming, all of which will be experienced in a terrifying atmosphere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/0fca95bfc0adf963f14e1cd51e58f1d1.poster.avif?t=1750206690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/0fca95bfc0adf963f14e1cd51e58f1d1.webm?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/0fca95bfc0adf963f14e1cd51e58f1d1.mp4?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll experience this amazing and exciting adventure from a first-person perspective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are simple and consist of only interacting, walking, running, and jumping. Because these actions are enough to help you escape from the nightmare.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter a variety of puzzles, including normal puzzles, puzzles with monster chases, mazes, platform jumping, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, many incredible things will happen, infinite staircases, strange rooms, weird roads, as bizarre as a dream.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/d0de0a8445fe224ef41e87a3efed50c8.poster.avif?t=1750206690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/d0de0a8445fe224ef41e87a3efed50c8.webm?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/d0de0a8445fe224ef41e87a3efed50c8.mp4?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the author</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I often dream, some are beautiful dreams, some are nightmares, some are predictive dreams, some are inexplicable dreams, some are dreams within dreams, and some are sexy dreams. But among all the dreams, the ones that I remember most are nightmares. I often think of these nightmares and try to figure out their causes, but what fascinates me most is the real sense of terror when I have nightmares. So I made this game to record or reproduce that feeling. I hope everyone can experience it too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/1f6db370a28037dfc150c4a79700fb1b.poster.avif?t=1750206690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/1f6db370a28037dfc150c4a79700fb1b.webm?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/1f6db370a28037dfc150c4a79700fb1b.mp4?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discord\uff1auRsZKAPckK</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><a href=\"mailto:Email\uff1a2243247594@qq.com\">Email\uff1a2243247594@qq.com</a></strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503340/1e7b2e2e1058f06cc653eeae0cb81cbf312d5220.jpg"},{"name":"LightSwitch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503340/7c3e43118447349cf5ead4904195587882c0fe15.jpg"},{"name":"-18","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503340/4a1d32d274b13fa3af89c0402d2c56b00ab02793.jpg"},{"name":"Lights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503340/05175017a052e1aa0fd2745ecff11f46dcb38de5.jpg"},{"name":"Highway","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503340/63cf8852ade3c18766e2d6aead07f5f8beb3cc94.jpg"},{"name":"Hell And Heaven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503340/8917d333f8f803074e9b263668d4697f9c97091b.jpg"},{"name":"Outside","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503340/52d18195973cf45a0cd80ff2b614fe336c3dfd5d.jpg"},{"name":"Big or Small?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503340/b207f32f997ef2882fe0aeba24ce21be7aff5c5b.jpg"},{"name":"Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503340/c81fce009de99bb15735d69265e2b019adc4eb58.jpg"},{"name":"GoldenDream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3503340/b87a7ca892beefee7bbae16e65960ea7199a22c5.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503340?t=1750206690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750206690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/548c685eabe0c382a3e0777488e837fd03a42738/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750206690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/548c685eabe0c382a3e0777488e837fd03a42738/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750206690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains suicide and violence"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3524430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up from a nightmare. You can't count how many times you've had a nightmare this month. But this time, after waking up, you find some strange phenomena in your house. You want to go out to see, but the door is locked...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/39c18655a986beddb63b5a10d01ce302.poster.avif?t=1750206690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/39c18655a986beddb63b5a10d01ce302.webm?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/39c18655a986beddb63b5a10d01ce302.mp4?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this game, you play as an ordinary man living in an apartment and trying his best to escape this nightmare. The main focus of the game is puzzle exploration, followed by some parkour and platforming, all of which will be experienced in a terrifying atmosphere.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/0fca95bfc0adf963f14e1cd51e58f1d1.poster.avif?t=1750206690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/0fca95bfc0adf963f14e1cd51e58f1d1.webm?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/0fca95bfc0adf963f14e1cd51e58f1d1.mp4?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll experience this amazing and exciting adventure from a first-person perspective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are simple and consist of only interacting, walking, running, and jumping. Because these actions are enough to help you escape from the nightmare.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter a variety of puzzles, including normal puzzles, puzzles with monster chases, mazes, platform jumping, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, many incredible things will happen, infinite staircases, strange rooms, weird roads, as bizarre as a dream.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/d0de0a8445fe224ef41e87a3efed50c8.poster.avif?t=1750206690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/d0de0a8445fe224ef41e87a3efed50c8.webm?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/d0de0a8445fe224ef41e87a3efed50c8.mp4?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the author</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I often dream, some are beautiful dreams, some are nightmares, some are predictive dreams, some are inexplicable dreams, some are dreams within dreams, and some are sexy dreams. But among all the dreams, the ones that I remember most are nightmares. I often think of these nightmares and try to figure out their causes, but what fascinates me most is the real sense of terror when I have nightmares. So I made this game to record or reproduce that feeling. I hope everyone can experience it too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/1f6db370a28037dfc150c4a79700fb1b.poster.avif?t=1750206690\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/1f6db370a28037dfc150c4a79700fb1b.webm?t=1750206690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503340/extras/1f6db370a28037dfc150c4a79700fb1b.mp4?t=1750206690\" t